  "id": "inversion",
  "term": "inversion",
  "definition": "In this developmental context, inversion means a fundamental reversal in how development is understood. It refers to replacing an adult-centered, linear view of the child as incomplete with a relational view that treats the child as a present, active participant in mutual development.",
